{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Welcome to Hell!</u></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769400/extras/1e5552309d34c1499efa7f6854af1032.avif?t=1768500150\" width=1170 height=240 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 In Deal me, Devil!, a comedic platformer with hand-drawn graphics, you play as an imp who was once an ordinary human - an unlucky one. After signing an unread contract with the devil, you gained luck but lost your body. Now, as an imp, you must escape Hell by conquering brutally difficult levels, unlocking new abilities, and meeting increasingly tempting devilish vixens. Along the way, you'll meet Smashington, a hammer with a similar past who shares your fate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>What awaits you?</strong></u><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769400/extras/1c2cc30cee7d97767190e12b3e884b62.avif?t=1768500150\" width=1170 height=320 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 Precise platformer: jump, dodge traps, swing your hammer, and overcome obstacles in 4 unique worlds.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer 17 levels: Each level tests your agility and reflexes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover 15 characters: Meet unique devilish vixens and uncover their secrets.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade as you go: Find items to aid you on your hellish journey.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The better your score, the more eager the vixens become.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be quick and agile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769400/extras/fc9f4089edd52113eb4867a368fa9f64.poster.avif?t=1768500150\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769400/extras/fc9f4089edd52113eb4867a368fa9f64.webm?t=1768500150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769400/extras/fc9f4089edd52113eb4867a368fa9f64.mp4?t=1768500150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge shooting hellish butts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769400/extras/8958b225f9d3a00fd2fec75766665958.poster.avif?t=1768500150\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769400/extras/8958b225f9d3a00fd2fec75766665958.webm?t=1768500150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769400/extras/8958b225f9d3a00fd2fec75766665958.mp4?t=1768500150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a ride on the hellish train.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769400/extras/85ea54adcd162e93e47a447e795ef2e8.poster.avif?t=1768500150\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769400/extras/85ea54adcd162e93e47a447e795ef2e8.webm?t=1768500150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769400/extras/85ea54adcd162e93e47a447e795ef2e8.mp4?t=1768500150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragrap